@FinanceApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5096

### Import a CIBC statement (account: CreditCard, Chequing or Savings)
POST {{FinanceApi_HostAddress}}/api/Transaction/Import
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=statement

--statement
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="account"

CreditCard
--statement
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="cibc_credit.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ../Finance.Cli/Files/CIBC/cibc_credit.csv
--statement--

###

GET {{FinanceApi_HostAddress}}/api/Transaction/GetAll
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{FinanceApi_HostAddress}}/health
